§ `What turns on the readings`

-- Every combination of the four readings, for the same facts.  A person does not choose a reading; a court does.
-- Readings applied OF: s 95 Reading A, Rg 6 reg 22(1) Reading Y, N 1 item 11(e) Reading Y, s 2 'equipment' Reading Q.

-- s 95: Reading A against Reading B for a listed kind (conduct 1 Jan 2011 read 1 Aug 2012, when S 549/2012 is not yet published): A no offence, B an offence
