§ `The Broadcasting Act's receiver licensing regulations (Rg 1), the second Broadcasting Act input: S 548/2012 and S 549/2012 move together`

-- Rg 1 (Revised Edition 2004, 29 Feb 2004) licenses broadcast sound and television receivers under s 20(1) of the Broadcasting Act; S 548/2012, first published 31 Oct 2012 at 5.00 pm (the hour of S 549/2012),
-- revokes it and is deemed in operation from 1 Jan 2011.  Conduct and reading days, as for the First Schedule.
