§ `Rg 5 and N 1 as made: the days of 2001`

-- N 1 (S 115/2001) and Rg 5 (S 114/2001) are both first published and in operation on 2 March 2001, so conduct before that day has no instrument to read: NOTHING.
-- From 2 March 2001 the Regulations as made and N 1 as made are in force; the four amendments of Rg 5 in 2001 (S 339/2001 on 9 Jul, S 374/2001 on 1 Aug, S 450/2001 on 18 Sep) amend fees, reg 26(4), reg 28(1) and names in the First Schedule, none of which the seat reads,
