§ `Rg 1 has three versions: what each said in terms about a licence, on both axes (added 2026-11-04, after the team lead's reading of S 333/2004)`

-- The Revised Edition 2004 (in operation 29 Feb 2004) says in reg 27(1) 'No person shall operate a broadcast television receiver without a licence'.
-- S 333/2004 (made 11 Jun 2004, first published 15 Jun 2004 at 5:00 pm, in operation 21 Jun 2004) cl 12(a) deletes reg 27(1) and (2) and substitutes a paragraph (1) that says only where to apply;
-- cl 11(a) does the same to reg 23(1) and (2), whose new (2) names a vessel only; cl 14 inserts reg 29A (a commercial property).  S 548/2012 (published 31 Oct 2012, deemed in operation 1 Jan 2011) revokes Rg 1.
-- The strings are quotations; scratchpad/tools/verify-quotes-rg1.py checks every quoted fragment against the deposited texts (22 fragments, none missing, 2026-11-04).

